        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and assuming our can maintain The global budget for this project, our projected cost would be 70 percent of the revenue (since 100% - 28% margin = 72% cost, but considering the need for precise calculation based on provided data, let's proceed with understanding that our costs are a percentage of the revenue)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, to accurately assess our cost structure and potential margin, our must consider our financials. our annual revenue is 4,200,000 euros, with a net profit of 380,000 euros, indicating a net profit margin of approximately 9 percent." ;
