        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these financial metrics and The global budget for this project, our can infer that our actual costs for delivering projects are likely structured around maintaining profitability while aiming for The global budget for this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs while ensuring quality of service for the City of Belval, our could consider strategies such as: - Renegotiating rates with subcontractors if possible. - Streamlining project delivery processes to reduce waste and enhance efficiency. - Implementing cost-saving technologies or methodologies that do not compromise on quality. - Offering flexible pricing models that align with the client's budgetary constraints while ensuring our target margins are maintained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It's crucial to note, however, that without specific details on this project scope, the exact services required, and how the exact services required align with our standard daily rates and infrastructure margin percentages, providing a precise projected margin or detailed cost optimization strategy is challenging. our would need to conduct a thorough analysis of the project requirements against our pricing model and cost structure to offer tailored solutions that meet both the client's needs and our financial objectives." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, the target gross margin percentage is 28 percent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
